   - **Additional Considerations:** A more detailed plan regarding user interaction with logged data would be beneficial\xa1\xaahow does a user navigate back to see their logs, and are they able to edit or delete entries once logged? These usability aspects might also involve adding information into the plan about how the GUI should transition between different frames and what happens on button clicks.

